## Type System
- Use const assertions over enums with type extraction
- Use types over interfaces
- Never use `any` type
- Use branded types for type-safe IDs
- Define return types for all functions explicitly

## Code Organization
- Follow functional programming principles where possible
- Avoid variable reassignment after initialization
- Keep functions pure when possible
- Handle side effects in dedicated composables/services
- Use immutable data structures

## Testing
- Test files location: `__specs__` folder adjacent to SUT
- Test file naming: `{original-name}.spec.ts`
- Test descriptions: follow given/when/then
- Test structure: use // Arrange, // Act, // Assert comments
- Mock naming: suffix with Mock (e.g., serviceMock)
- Spy naming: suffix with Spy (e.g., methodSpy)
- Test data: use test-utils for random data generation
- Variable naming: use 'target' for system under test
- Coverage: minimum 80% for all production code
- Required test for all production code except those in jest-e2e.json
- Prefer ordinal matching like `toHaveBeenNthCalledWith` over plain argument matching `toHaveBeenCalledWith`
